WEBVTT

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:00.936
(Kicheko)

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:03.696
Unajua hio ni nini -- hali ya kutokua na
kahawa.

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:05.856
(Kicheko)

00:04:05.880 --> 00:04:09.616
Hivyo, Chung ameshakua na watu
wanampigia kelele mpaka akalia,

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:11.656
ikiwemo binti wa miaka tisa,

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:15.936
ambae hakupenda mchoro wa malai
ambao Chung aliweka kwenye chokoleti yake.


00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:18.856
Hivyo nikamshukuru Chung,

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:22.055
na akanishukuru kwa kumshukuru.

00:04:22.079 --> 00:04:23.336
Nikaikatia hapo.

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:25.776
Sikutaka uwe kwenye mzunguko
wa shukrani usioisha.

00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:27.376
(Kicheko)

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:31.136
Lakini Chung alisema sehemu ngumu ya zote